                "message": "Fix casting a ctuple to a ctuple with different item types\n\nC cannot cast one struct type to another, so '<(int, int)>t' for a\n'(double, double)' ctuple generated invalid C code. Cast each item\nseparately instead and report an error if the sizes differ.\n\nCloses https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/7708",
